        "content": "## AAC Phase 1C - Realtime Session Bootstrap\n\nCompatibility build for the current n8n instance.\n\nFlow:\nWebhook \u2192 BigQuery validation \u2192 IF \u2192 OpenAI Realtime client secret \u2192 response\n\nAfter import:\n1. Connect the existing BigQuery credential.\n2. In **Mint OpenAI Realtime Client Secret**, select **OpenAi account**.\n3. Do not activate yet. We will test first.\n\nThe OpenAI request uses `POST /v1/realtime/client_secrets` with `gpt-realtime-2.1`.",
